"solution": "template<typename Data>\nvoid ElementarySort::selection_sort(Data *arr, const int len) {\n    for (int i = 0; i < len; i++) {\n        int min = i;\n        for (int j = i + 1; j < len; j++) {\n            if (arr[j] < arr[min]) {\n                min = j;\n            }\n        }\n        swap(arr, min, i);\n    }\n}\n",
