"desc": "Swap each element to the left while it is smaller than its left neighbour; stop at the first one that is not.",
"kind": "lab",
"descNote": " One test uses a <code>Counted</code> type that counts every comparison, so your code has to follow the lab algorithm: a different algorithm (or <code>std::sort</code>) gives a different count and fails that test.",
