"show": "namespace ElementarySort {\n    template<typename Data>\n    static void swap(Data* arr, int a, int b);\n    template<typename Data>\n    void selection_sort(Data* arr, int len);\n    template<typename Data>\n    void insertion_sort(Data* arr, int len);\n    template<typename Data>\n    void shell_sort(Data* arr, int len);\n}\n",
"solution": "template<typename Data>\nvoid ElementarySort::insertion_sort(Data *arr, const int len) {\n    for (int i = 1; i < len; i++) {\n        for (int j = i; j > 0; j--) {\n            if (arr[j] < arr[j - 1]) {\n                swap(arr, j, j - 1);\n            } else {\n                break;\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n",
